<div class="dashboard-tab-panel" data-dashboard-panel="month-close" hidden>
    <section class="mc" id="monthCloseApp" data-index-url="@Url.Action("Index","MonthClose")" data-report-url="@Url.Action("Report","MonthClose")" data-export-url="@Url.Action("Export","MonthClose")">
        <header class="mc-heading">
            <div><span class="mc-eyebrow">HISTORIA FINANCIERA · DIGITAL TECH</span><h2>Cierre de mes</h2><p>Reportes y soportes de cada mes. La misma cifra cuando vuelvas.</p></div>
            <div class="mc-controls"><label>Año<select id="mcYear" aria-label="Año del cierre"></select></label><button type="button" id="mcRefresh" class="mc-button">↻ Consultar cierres</button></div>
        </header>
        <div id="mcStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite" class="mc-status">Selecciona esta pestaña para consultar los cierres.</div>
        <nav id="mcMonths" class="mc-months" aria-label="Mes del cierre"></nav>
        <div id="mcEmpty" class="mc-empty" hidden></div>
        <div id="mcContent" hidden>
            <div class="mc-seal"><div><strong id="mcPeriodTitle"></strong><span id="mcMode" class="mc-badge"></span><p id="mcCapture"></p></div><label>Versión guardada<select id="mcVersion" aria-label="Versión del cierre"></select></label></div>
            <div id="mcMetrics" class="mc-metrics"></div>
            <div class="mc-charts">
                <article class="mc-panel"><div class="mc-panel-title"><div><h3>Cartera por vencimiento</h3><p>Saldo identificable al corte · COP</p></div><span class="mc-chart-icon">◷</span></div><div id="mcAging" class="mc-bars"></div></article>
                <article class="mc-panel"><div class="mc-panel-title"><div><h3>Facturación por negocio</h3><p>Base identificable · COP</p></div><span class="mc-chart-icon">▥</span></div><div id="mcLines" class="mc-bars"></div></article>
            </div>
            <article class="mc-panel"><div class="mc-panel-title"><div><h3>El año, mes a mes</h3><p>Base disponible, descontando notas crédito identificadas. Cada mes muestra su cobertura.</p></div><span class="mc-badge">Datos guardados</span></div><div id="mcTrend" class="mc-trend" aria-label="Facturación mensual"></div></article>
            <div class="mc-section-title"><h3>Reportes del cierre</h3><span>Abre un reporte para ver su detalle y cobertura</span></div>
            <div id="mcReports" class="mc-reports"></div>
            <section class="mc-panel" id="mcDetail" hidden aria-labelledby="mcDetailTitle">
                <div class="mc-panel-title"><div><h3 id="mcDetailTitle"></h3><p id="mcDetailSubtitle"></p></div><a id="mcExport" class="mc-button" href="#">↓ Descargar Excel</a></div>
                <div id="mcBankAccounts" class="mc-bank-accounts" hidden></div>
                <p id="mcNeeded" class="mc-needed"></p>
                <div class="mc-detail-tools"><input id="mcSearch" type="search" placeholder="Buscar documento, cliente o comprobante…" aria-label="Buscar en el reporte"><span id="mcCount"></span></div>
                <div class="mc-table-wrap"><table><caption class="visually-hidden" id="mcTableCaption">Detalle del reporte de cierre mensual</caption><thead id="mcTableHead"></thead><tbody id="mcTableBody"></tbody></table></div>
                <div class="mc-pagination"><button type="button" id="mcPrevious" class="mc-button">← Anterior</button><span id="mcPage"></span><button type="button" id="mcNext" class="mc-button">Siguiente →</button></div>
            </section>
            <details class="mc-panel mc-evidence"><summary>Alcance, calidad e integridad del cierre</summary><ul id="mcWarnings"></ul><p>Los pagos posteriores no alteran este corte. Las correcciones se conservan como otra versión, sin reemplazar la anterior.</p><p>Los reportes operativos solo se capturan cuando existe información temporal suficiente. “Pendiente” no significa saldo cero.</p><code id="mcHash"></code></details>
        </div>
        <footer class="mc-footer">Corte en hora de Colombia · Captura automática al iniciar cada mes · Datos consultados solo al abrir el detalle</footer>
    </section>
</div>
